# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

List of maintainers and subsystem file patterns for the Keira Kernel project.
Modeled after the Linux Kernel MAINTAINERS specification.

The fields are:
	P: Person (Maintainer Name)
	M: Maintainer Email
	W: Web page / Repository
	S: Subsystem Status (Supported, Maintained, Odd Fixes, Orphan, Obsolete)
	F: Files and directories matching this subsystem

